                                : `<span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-blue-200 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-box-open text-blue-500"></i> Chờ phát thuốc</span>`;

